{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>The Mysterious Backrooms</strong>, a first-person exploration horror game that plunges you into the liminal, endless, and terrifying spaces just beyond our reality. Inspired by internet creepypasta lore, urban legends, and the fear of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate eerily familiar and claustrophobic environments filled with flickering fluorescent lights, moist carpets, and the low hum of nothingness. Each level of the Backrooms is handcrafted with unique environments, threats, and rules. What worked before might get you killed next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone. Something is here with you. Some entities can be avoided, some can be outrun, but others... you might never even see coming.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936550?t=1755790415","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936550?t=1755790415","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936550/9f9b6ef79e3073aad4dcba85116685034c91428d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755790415","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936550/9f9b6ef79e3073aad4dcba85116685034c91428d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755790415","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>The Mysterious Backrooms</strong>, a first-person exploration horror game that plunges you into the liminal, endless, and terrifying spaces just beyond our reality. Inspired by internet creepypasta lore, urban legends, and the fear of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate eerily familiar and claustrophobic environments filled with flickering fluorescent lights, moist carpets, and the low hum of nothingness. Each level of the Backrooms is handcrafted with unique environments, threats, and rules. What worked before might get you killed next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone. Something is here with you. Some entities can be avoided, some can be outrun, but others... you might never even see coming.</p>","developers":["Tutaago Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936550/3321aa7dda980fa6452eff8906de762434f7d9fe/header.jpg?t=1755790415","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3936550/1246791312/e40264035049f10455919617369240961803b521/1754751402/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755790413","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3936550/1246791312/e40264035049f10455919617369240961803b521/1754751402/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755790413","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3936550/1246791312/e40264035049f10455919617369240961803b521/1754751402/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755790413","id":257180818,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180818/movie480.mp4?t=1755790413","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180818/movie_max.mp4?t=1755790413"},"name":"The Mysterious Backrooms trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257180818/ddd4ea763162e10e386cf04e910b64486efbfad9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755790413","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180818/movie480_vp9.webm?t=175